/* FOUR CLIENTS GET THEIR ICONS (§629)

   Islam, 2026-10-26, handing over five square logos: *"for the clients icon
   mark not for elabd can you use these logos for the clients in order
   Forefront, RHI, Raya, Wander the black one"*. So Forefront, RHI, Raya Trade
   and Wander carry an icon of their own on Home; El Abd is left as it is
   (its initials, its word-mark being wide).

   Each is a 128px square PNG data URI, the same value the Brand tab's "Its
   own icon" stores, and well under its 200 000-character cap. Matched by key
   or by name, since a client's address is the office's to choose. Running
   again writes the same picture, so a second run changes nothing. */

UPDATE tenants SET icon = 'data:image/png;base64,'
 WHERE key = 'forefront' OR name ILIKE 'forefront%';

UPDATE tenants SET icon = 'data:image/png;base64,'
 WHERE key = 'rhi' OR name ILIKE 'rhi%';

UPDATE tenants SET icon = 'data:image/png;base64,'
 WHERE key = 'raya-trade' OR name ILIKE 'raya%';

UPDATE tenants SET icon = 'data:image/png;base64,'
 WHERE key LIKE 'wander%' OR name ILIKE 'wander%';
